    "text": "KDRV\nwebsite\nSiskiyou County, California\nPerch Fire fully contained in Siskiyou County\nBy Liv Collom,\n13 hours agoSISKIYOU COUNTY, Calif. – UPDATE 4:39 p.m.: Per CAL FIRE the fire’s final size is 24.4 acres and is currently 100% contained. Evacuation Warnings (BE READY TO LEAVE IMMEDIATELY!): None. Acreage: 24.4. Containment: 75%. Closures: None. Firefighting Efforts:. Evacuation routes/road closures:. Evacuation Centers:. Evacuation Centers for pets:. Miscellaneous:\n1",
